44px;\"></o:p></p><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;line-height: 1.8em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px 8px;text-indent: 0em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-decoration: none;\">绿宝石<span style=\"caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;orphans: 2;widows: 2;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">由Norbey Quimbayo和他的妻子打理，<span style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;orphans: 2;text-indent: 8px;widows: 2;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Norbey继承了父亲庄园后一开始他跟其它咖农一样生产商业咖啡，但2006年金融危机危机和咖啡价格下跌之后，利润开始逐渐下滑。Norbey决定到哥伦比亚咖啡学院研修，在那里他学习了很多不同的方法来改善他的咖啡品质，从而获得更高的收入和溢价。</span></span></span></section><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"\"/><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TMtZic4lguS5W1IOh4iamxWnGl57KvrIrF5vHWeUTkWJRKzSypLsicPCI0ozibfwWChhjUFbEggMzHxQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></p><p \"hiragino=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" \"pingfang=\"\" 0.544px;margin-right:=\"\" 0px;font-variant-ligatures:=\"\" 8px;margin-left:=\"\" 8px;outline:=\"\" arial,=\"\" gb\",=\"\" helvetica=\"\" neue\",=\"\" normal;visibility:=\"\" sans=\"\" sans-serif;letter-spacing:=\"\" sc\",=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \" ui\",=\"\" visible;\"=\"\" yahei=\"\" yahei\",=\"\"><o:p style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\"></o:p></p><p \"hiragino=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" \"pingfang=\"\" 0.544px;margin-right:=\"\" 0px;font-variant-ligatures:=\"\" 8px;margin-left:=\"\" 8px;outline:=\"\" arial,=\"\" gb\",=\"\" helvetica=\"\" neue\",=\"\" normal;visibility:=\"\" sans=\"\" sans-serif;letter-spacing:=\"\" sc\",=\"\" style=\